{
    "title": "The Army: Age of War",
    "description": "<b>The Army: Age of War</b> is the ultimate idle strategy game where you are an army builder with a list of tower, archer, ax, onager, hammer to defeat competitors. Easy to play but challenging to master, this game offers a relaxing yet strategic play like other warrior games. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca5<b>This army game is ideal for who love:</b>\r\nUpgrade and Evolve: Enhance the idle army to strengthen levels and powers. You can build your army with power-up, speed acceleration, and health booster. \r\nVarious Levels Of Army: Join in different battles, facing various idle army and challenges. Each uniquely arranged with different booster and energy setups. Adapt your strategy to conquer each mini warriors challenge.\r\nIdle Mechanics: Enjoy the thrill of strategic army battles without constant observation & playing. Progress through the game at your own pace and let your army fight even when you're away.\r\nStrategic Gameplay: Accumulate points and stars to enhance energy and power, crucial for overcoming tougher opponents and advancing through levels of idle army.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae<b>How to win:</b>\r\nSelect Your Idle Army Unit: Choose the appropriate combination of warriors and weapons to form a formidable army in the world of warriors.\r\nAccumulate Resources: Earn points and stars by defeating enemies. Use these resources to upgrade your units and boost your energy and power.\r\nStrategize and Adapt: Each level presents a new challenge with different enemy formations and weapon setups. Adapt your strategy to ensure victory in pocket army.\r\nProgress Through Levels: Advance through increasingly difficult levels, refining your strategy and enhancing your army's capabilities.\r\n\r\nAre you ready to start your passionate idle journey with this warrior game?",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>The Army: Age of War</b> is the ultimate idle strategy game where you are an army builder with a list of tower, archer, ax, onager, hammer to defeat competitors. Easy to play but challenging to master, this game offers a relaxing yet strategic play like other warrior games. <br><br>\ud83d\udca5<b>This army game is ideal for who love:</b><br>Upgrade and Evolve: Enhance the idle army to strengthen levels and powers. You can build your army with power-up, speed acceleration, and health booster. <br>Various Levels Of Army: Join in different battles, facing various idle army and challenges. Each uniquely arranged with different booster and energy setups. Adapt your strategy to conquer each mini warriors challenge.<br>Idle Mechanics: Enjoy the thrill of strategic army battles without constant observation &amp; playing. Progress through the game at your own pace and let your army fight even when you&#39;re away.<br>Strategic Gameplay: Accumulate points and stars to enhance energy and power, crucial for overcoming tougher opponents and advancing through levels of idle army.<br><br>\ud83c\udfae<b>How to win:</b><br>Select Your Idle Army Unit: Choose the appropriate combination of warriors and weapons to form a formidable army in the world of warriors.<br>Accumulate Resources: Earn points and stars by defeating enemies. Use these resources to upgrade your units and boost your energy and power.<br>Strategize and Adapt: Each level presents a new challenge with different enemy formations and weapon setups. Adapt your strategy to ensure victory in pocket army.<br>Progress Through Levels: Advance through increasingly difficult levels, refining your strategy and enhancing your army&#39;s capabilities.<br><br>Are you ready to start your passionate idle journey with this warrior game?",
